# Optional: copy to ~/myLab/.cursorignore when you open ~/myLab as the Cursor workspace.
# Keeps sibling repos' heavy dirs out of AI context (indexing still follows each repo's .gitignore).

**/.git/
**/node_modules/
**/vendor/
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
**/target/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/.bundle/
**/_site/
*.zip
